        "id": 1,
        "options": {
          "code": {
            "language": "plaintext",
            "showLineNumbers": false,
            "showMiniMap": false
          },
          "content": "## Threat Hunting — Log Investigation\nWhen analysts need to dig deep, **Grafana Explore** gives them lightning-fast query capabilities across all ingested security logs to trace the adversary's steps.\n\n**Query your logs like a threat hunter:** Use the [Explore view](http://localhost:3000/explore?orgId=1\u0026left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22secops-loki%22%7D) (`Explore →` in the left nav) to run ad-hoc LogQL queries against SentinelOne + Rapid7 + ServiceNow event streams.\n\n\u003e **Sigma rules:** The pre-built queries below mirror [Sigma rule](https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma) detection logic translated to LogQL — no ETL required.",
          "mode": "markdown"
        },
        "pluginVersion": "10.4.1",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "thresholds"
            },
            "mappings": [],
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "blue"
                }
              ]
            },
            "unit": "short"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 3,
          "w": 4,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 4
        },
        "id": 2,
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "orientation": "auto",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "showPercentChange": false,
          "textMode": "auto",
          "wideLayout": true
        },
        "pluginVersion": "10.4.1",
        "targets": [
          {
            "datasource": {
              "type": "loki",
              "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
            },
            "expr": "count(sum by (host) (count_over_time({job=\"secops\", severity=~\"CRITICAL|HIGH\"}[12h])))",
            "legendFormat": "Hosts",
            "queryType": "range",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Unique Hosts Under Investigation",
        "type": "stat"
